{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "personal-os-api-collection",
    "name": "Personal OS API",
    "description": "Colección para el backend NestJS de Personal OS (core infrastructure).\n\n## Importar\nPostman → Import → `postman.json` + `postman.environment.json`\n\n## Autenticación\n1. Configura `supabaseUrl`, `supabaseAnonKey`, `supabaseEmail`, `supabasePassword` (entorno o colección).\n2. Ejecuta **Supabase Auth → Sign in (password)** — guarda `accessToken` y `userId`.\n3. El resto de requests usa Bearer `{{accessToken}}` (heredado de la colección).\n\n## Respuestas API\nÉxito: `{ \"data\": ..., \"meta\": { timestamp, path, requestId } }`\nError: `{ statusCode, error, message, requestId, ... }`\n\n## WebSocket\nSocket.IO en `/notifications` — usar cliente Socket.IO, no REST.\n\n**Docs:** `docs/core-infrastructure.md` · **Swagger:** `{{baseUrl}}/{{swaggerPath}}`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'x-request-id', value: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3100", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "apiPrefix", "value": "api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "swaggerPath", "value": "docs", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "supabaseUrl", "value": "https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "supabaseAnonKey", "value": "YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "supabaseEmail", "value": "you@example.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "supabasePassword", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "sessionId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "pushToken", "value": "expo-push-token-example", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "moduleSlug", "value": "finance", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Supabase Auth",
      "description": "Login directo contra Supabase Auth API. No pasa por NestJS. Tras **Sign in**, `accessToken` se usa en el resto de la colección.",
      "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign in (password)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (body.refresh_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refresh_token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', body.refresh_token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (body.user && body.user.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "}",
                  "console.log('accessToken set:', !!body.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{supabaseAnonKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{supabaseEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{supabasePassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password",
              "host": ["{{supabaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" }]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene `access_token` (JWT) y lo guarda en `accessToken`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign up",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (body.user && body.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{supabaseAnonKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{supabaseEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{supabasePassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/signup",
              "host": ["{{supabaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "signup"]
            },
            "description": "Registro. Si Confirm email está activo en Supabase, puede no devolver sesión hasta confirmar."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (body.refresh_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refresh_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('refreshToken', body.refresh_token);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{supabaseAnonKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=refresh_token",
              "host": ["{{supabaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "refresh_token" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Supabase user",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "apikey", "value": "{{supabaseAnonKey}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/user",
              "host": ["{{supabaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "user"]
            },
            "description": "Usuario en Supabase Auth (no confundir con GET /api/users/me del backend)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Meta",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Swagger UI",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{swaggerPath}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["{{swaggerPath}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "OpenAPI JSON",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{swaggerPath}}-json",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["{{swaggerPath}}-json"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = json.data || json;",
                  "pm.test('status ok', () => pm.expect(data.status).to.eql('ok'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{apiPrefix}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["{{apiPrefix}}", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Público. Respuesta envelope: `data.status`, `data.timestamp`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = json.data || json;",
                  "pm.test('readiness up', () => pm.expect(data.status).to.eql('ok'));",
                  "pm.test('database check present', () => pm.expect(data.info.database.status).to.eql('up'));",
                  "pm.test('jwks check present', () => pm.expect(data.info.jwks.status).to.eql('up'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{apiPrefix}}/health/ready",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["{{apiPrefix}}", "health", "ready"]
            },
            "description": "Readiness probe con checks de database, JWKS y Redis (si BullMQ está habilitado)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth (API)",
      "description": "Endpoints NestJS. Requieren JWT de Supabase en Bearer.",
      "item": [
